`firstContent?.content` — 1 hop from a local variable. Chains starting from a local variable count each member access after the identifier: `lastMessage.content` would be 1 hop, `.content[0]` 2 hops, `.content[0]?.content` 3 hops. So splitting at `[0]` gives max 2 hops per statement. 

